
Fix problem with mktemp.c (causing command "mget *" in ftp to core dump)
by changing the following lines:

Line 63 changing
   for(i = 1; i <= TMPSIZE; i++)  {
to
   for(i = 0; i <= TMPSIZE; i++)  {

line 68 changing
   t[TMPSIZE + 1] = '\0';
to
   t[TMPSIZE] = '\0';

